Dear RT Folks,

I'm pleased to announce the 3.14.34-rt31 stable release.


This release is just an update to the new stable 3.14.34 version
and no RT specific changes have been made.


You can get this release via the git tree at:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rt/linux-stable-rt.git

  branch: v3.14-rt
  Head SHA1: 287fe3d1679207114e42153d3259e3565f3c9b1d


Or to build 3.14.34-rt31 directly, the following patches should be applied:

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/linux-3.14.tar.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/patch-3.14.34.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/3.14/patch-3.14.34-rt31.patch.xz




Enjoy,

-- Steve

